  <item>
    <title>【星座目录】摩羯座：诚实地自恋，漂亮地成功</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e6818ead514f3bc836669d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e6818ead514f3bc836669d</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 06 Mar 2024 03:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本系列中，我们将从人格关键词、人生主题、困惑与发展等方面针对具体星座的经验展开叙述，以实现理解。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在和一位占星爱好者的摩羯嘉宾聊了之后，我们会将摩羯座的关键词概括为：整合、自我认可、高姿态。摩羯座必须觉醒自己的权力欲，发掘自己的成功需求，并寻找自己施加影响力的方式，这是自然的，也是必要的。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a> intro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="185">3:05</a> 摩羯关键词：自恋，傲慢，整合</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="346">5:46</a> 以体面的姿态入世，不断加深自我认可</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1026">17:06</a> 成功：权力是自我成长的必需品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1322">22:02</a> 野心家：救世主心态，天选打工人技能，操纵能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1779">29:39</a> 失败：休想破摩羯的防</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2102">35:02</a> 充满强度的静止：耐心是通往成功的必经之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2380">39:40</a> 钝感：调动情绪是消耗能量的，混沌和未知是不可接受的，诚实是必须的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3178">52:58</a> 爹感：影响力是权力欲的蔓延，永远保持高姿态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3630">60:30</a> 石头，痛苦与冷漠</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span>"Heroes" — David Bowie</span></p>]]></description>
