  <item>
    <title>【圣杯三】世界上的假货太多了，身心灵也一样</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6528123319dde7bf6a5cd588</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6528123319dde7bf6a5cd588</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 13 Oct 2023 03:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“圣杯三”是我们围绕近期社会话题、生活经验开辟的栏目，不定期更新，时长较短，浅聊一下。</span></p><span></span><p><span>9月23-25日，互联网上接连曝出了“李松蔚被指控性侵女患者”和新周刊报道学霸猫的身心灵社群，这两个我们比较在意的社会新闻，因为它们都在某种程度上涉及了“借用语言与叙事进行有毒操控”，而这刚好触及了本台一直强调的关于命名权与神权的讨论，所以我们出了这期闲聊节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a> intro：新闻简报+讨论说明</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="273">4:33</a> 网络热门确诊：burnout，性缘脑，mbti</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a> 命名权与神权</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1327">22:07</a> “身心灵产业”：范畴，现状，词语中toxic的部分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1862">31:02</a> 学霸猫模式漫谈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2498">41:38</a> 关于语言主权</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span>Shonen — Mariah</span></p><span></span><p><span>提及内容</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qUZ-Otm22kD0svjt6dwANQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qUZ-Otm22kD0svjt6dwANQ"><span>加入灵修后，他们从裸辞到负债百万</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/EJb6YLYWkAHWBdtym5zVHA?from=10D9293010&amp;launchid=default&amp;WBAPIAnalysisOriUICodes=10000001_10000002&amp;v_p=90&amp;aid=01A-FFytHOCqIizvXU9XaRW5BaH2aF4MzF2fjvCTBV0R76cwI.&amp;wm=3333_2001&amp;theme=dark&amp;s_trans=2526753891_&amp;s_channel=4" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/EJb6YLYWkAHWBdtym5zVHA?from=10D9293010&amp;launchid=default&amp;WBAPIAnalysisOriUICodes=10000001_10000002&amp;v_p=90&amp;aid=01A-FFytHOCqIizvXU9XaRW5BaH2aF4MzF2fjvCTBV0R76cwI.&amp;wm=3333_2001&amp;theme=dark&amp;s_trans=2526753891_&amp;s_channel=4"><span>一个心理咨询室里的“疯”女人</span></a></p>]]></description>
